4003
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:31,190
Urie Kuki
Investigator Second Class
Quinx Squad Squad Leader

4004
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:40,500
This is fine.

4005
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:43,030
Wait, right here?

4006
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:45,030
I'm a ghoul investigator.

4007
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,300
It's easy to tell when you 
just wash it off lightly...

4008
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,710
The smell of blood.

4009
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,720
<i>Kagune...</i>

4010
00:03:10,610 --> 00:03:12,110
A quinque, huh?

4011
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:21,210
Is he rate A? No, B.

4012
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,290
He's not Torso.

4013
00:03:27,050 --> 00:03:30,000
Looks like you're unarmed, human.

4014
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:32,470
Let me eat you.

4015
00:03:34,330 --> 00:03:35,970
Let me eat you!

4016
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:44,060
Urie!

4017
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:46,970
Shirazu Zanshi
Investigator Third Class

4018
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:51,570
Third Class Shirazu, your attack hit me.

4019
00:03:51,570 --> 00:03:52,990
<i>The nuisance just had to show up.</i>

4020
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,970
What's this? Where's your quinque?

4021
00:03:55,970 --> 00:03:59,950
Did it break? Oh, dear. 
Come on, Squad Leader.

4022
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,830
Third Class Shirazu.

4023
00:04:01,830 --> 00:04:02,410
Huh?

4024
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,420
May you rest in peace.

4025
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:13,760
Heya.

4026
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,630
You're... ghouls!

4027
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,640
We Quinx...

4028
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,480
use your abilities.

4029
00:04:34,350 --> 00:04:36,340
He's my catch.

4030
00:04:36,340 --> 00:04:37,310
You can't be serious.

4031
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:39,530
I'm the one who lured this ghoul out.

4032
00:04:39,530 --> 00:04:42,880
It's all about how much you contributed.

4033
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:45,500
You merely followed me here.

4034
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:49,460
That strike you just did was 
80% possible because of me.

4035
00:04:50,130 --> 00:04:51,840
You never stop talking, do you?

4036
00:04:58,850 --> 00:05:00,050
Don't let your guard down.

4037
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:05,340
Those Who Hunt

4038
00:05:06,170 --> 00:05:09,980
It appears as though the ghoul that 
Investigator Urie and Shirazu from

4039
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:12,320
the Mado Squad encountered 
yesterday was not Torso.

4040
00:05:12,890 --> 00:05:16,050
We are in charge of Torso, 
after all, so we'd like for

4041
00:05:16,050 --> 00:05:19,900
you Mado Squad members to 
concentrate on something else.

4042
00:05:20,670 --> 00:05:24,830
By the way, there were reports of a ghoul's 
moaning being heard the other day,

4043
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:27,520
and after our days-long investigation,

4044
00:05:25,370 --> 00:05:29,780
Shimoguchi Nobu
Senior Investigator

4045
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,790
it was apparently just a stray dog?

4046
00:05:30,150 --> 00:05:33,730
Seriously, it's exhausting, isn't it?

4047
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:35,410
Sasaki Haise
Investigator First Class
Quinx Squad Mentor

4048
00:05:33,730 --> 00:05:35,750
Wipe that smile off your 
face, Investigator Sasaki.

4049
00:05:36,590 --> 00:05:40,540
Ito Kuramoto
Investigator First Class

4050
00:05:37,030 --> 00:05:40,270
Those Quinx subordinates of yours...

4051
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:43,580
All they seem to do is eat up our 
budget and not produce results.

4052
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:44,460
Hirako Take
Investigator First Class

4053
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,560
Well...

4054
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,810
Never mind the fact that

4055
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:49,050
Mado Akira
Senior Investigator

4056
00:05:45,810 --> 00:05:50,560
allowing people we can't confirm 
as human or ghoul to investigate is just...

4057
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:54,820
You didn't finish off that 
taxi driver yesterday.

4058
00:05:55,350 --> 00:05:58,930
What's the point of letting 
such a useless ghoul live?

4059
00:05:58,930 --> 00:05:59,820
Pardon me, but...

4060
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:02,510
Did you actually feel sorry for that ghoul?

4061
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:04,840
I guess I wouldn't be surprised.

4062
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,530
You are a ghoul afterâ

4063
00:06:06,530 --> 00:06:07,830
Investigator Shimoguchi,

4064
00:06:08,170 --> 00:06:13,150
I will be the one who will discipline 
my subordinate, and I will do so later.

4065
00:06:13,150 --> 00:06:14,490
Investigator Mado,

4066
00:06:14,490 --> 00:06:17,390
it appears that you're not 
disciplining him enough.

4067
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:20,630
I say this again, but I am 
in charge of the Torso case.

4068
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:23,710
Since you're taking so long 
with the investigation,

4069
00:06:23,710 --> 00:06:26,600
I'd say we couldn't help 
but try to lend you a hand.

4070
00:06:27,710 --> 00:06:29,200
Who do you think you're talking to?

4071
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:31,350
Investigator Shimoguchi, Investigator Mado,

4072
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:33,030
I believe that's enough.

4073
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:36,790
In regards to the Torso investigation,

4074
00:06:36,790 --> 00:06:41,240
I ask that the Shimoguchi Squad and the 
Mado Squad work together on the matter.

4075
00:06:41,690 --> 00:06:45,070
We, the Hirako Squad, 
will continue going after Orochi.

4076
00:06:45,590 --> 00:06:46,820
This ends our meeting for today.

4077
00:06:52,590 --> 00:06:54,560
You need to lose your kindness in battle.

4078
00:06:54,930 --> 00:06:57,460
That kindness will kill you.

4079
00:06:58,030 --> 00:07:00,470
You need to be stricter as a mentor.

4080
00:07:00,990 --> 00:07:03,700
Your kindness will also affect the Quinx.

4081
00:07:04,450 --> 00:07:08,970
Do not defend the ghouls, if you 
don't want another Mado punch.

4082
00:07:09,330 --> 00:07:10,890
Mado punch...

4083
00:07:10,890 --> 00:07:14,470
Anyway, we're going to get to 
Torso before the Shimoguchi Squad.

4084
00:07:14,790 --> 00:07:16,040
It can even be Orochi.

4085
00:07:16,490 --> 00:07:18,980
Investigator Arima has high hopes for you.

4086
00:07:20,110 --> 00:07:21,190
Mr. Arima does?

4087
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,700
<i>The Quinx Project...</i>

4088
00:07:26,030 --> 00:07:29,370
<i>Creating someone greater 
than Arima Kisho, huh...</i>

4089
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:33,400
A-Are you Orochi?

4090
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:36,670
Wow, is that what they're calling me?

4091
00:07:37,230 --> 00:07:40,460
You're a ghoul! Why are you after us?

4092
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:43,680
Uh, I don't have to explain myself to 
a sub character who's about to die.

4093
00:07:44,610 --> 00:07:47,480
Hey, ever hear of a ghoul named Torso?

4094
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,430
N-No! Iâ

4095
00:07:49,670 --> 00:07:52,810
And that's enough. Goodbye now.

4096
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:58,400
Squad Leader, you're being a jerk.

4097
00:07:59,030 --> 00:08:02,400
Not to mention, Sassan told 
us to stick together.

4098
00:08:03,070 --> 00:08:05,910
I don't plan to stay under 
Investigator Sasaki.

4099
00:08:06,690 --> 00:08:09,180
I'm going to hurry up and 
get promoted and go to S3.

4100
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:10,910
What the hell is S3?

4101
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,680
It's none of your concern.

4102
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:16,050
Anyway, just make sure 
you don't get in my way.

4103
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:20,170
Who gave you permission to boss me around?

4104
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:22,090
Wanna settle things right here, right now?

4105
00:08:22,090 --> 00:08:24,110
<i>Of course I have permission.</i>

4106
00:08:24,110 --> 00:08:25,430
<i>I'm the squad leader.</i>

4107
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:27,520
If you insist.

4108
00:08:35,210 --> 00:08:38,500
You guys are looking for a 
ghoul named Torso, right?

4109
00:08:39,370 --> 00:08:40,880
Want some information?

4110
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:47,730
You're such a wuss, Mutsuki.

4111
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:49,650
Mutsuki Toru
Investigator Third Class

4112
00:08:47,730 --> 00:08:49,660
I just can't...

4113
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:53,240
Whenever I see blood, I just...

4114
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,560
Are you able to use your kagune now?

4115
00:08:56,010 --> 00:08:57,670
No, not yet...

4116
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:00,150
So how are things going in the Quinx Squad?

4117
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:03,130
It's the same as usual. 
Everyone's doing whatever they want.

4118
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:04,560
It would appear so.

4119
00:09:05,070 --> 00:09:08,380
You and Urie are the only two who've 
shown up for your physicals.

4120
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:08,370
Shiba Ryojiro
Quinx's Doctor

4121
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,800
I'll talk to them.

4122
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,890
Thanks.

4123
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:18,640
It's not like they're going 
to listen to me, but...

4124
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,970
Driver's
License

4125
00:09:18,980 --> 00:09:20,320
Miss Hori Chie...

4126
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,260
And you're 24 years old?

4127
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:27,900
I sell the pictures I take, as well as 
any information I happen to gather.

4128
00:09:28,410 --> 00:09:31,410
So, what kind of information 
do you have on Torso?

4129
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:34,000
Here's a picture of Torso 
while he was feeding.

4130
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:36,290
It's gonna cost you.

4131
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:39,100
How much were you hoping for?

4132
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:40,990
One million.

4133
00:09:42,650 --> 00:09:43,230
Or...

4134
00:09:43,830 --> 00:09:45,950
one of Sasaki Haise's personal items.

4135
00:09:47,180 --> 00:09:51,100
The rest of the information will follow 
after we give her what she wants.

4136
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:54,640
Let's just ask Sassan for his underwear.

4137
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:58,430
Huh? What's wrong?

4138
00:09:58,980 --> 00:10:02,440
Shirazu, you need money, don't you?

4139
00:10:03,610 --> 00:10:04,940
Where'd that come from?

4140
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:08,040
Investigator Sasaki is our mentor.

4141
00:10:08,650 --> 00:10:12,670
If we report to him and 
capture Torso as a squad,

4142
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:15,580
that would reflect well on the squad.

4143
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:17,510
Well, yeah, obviously...

4144
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:18,550
Don't you get it?

4145
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:24,340
Depending on how he reports this, 
he could get all the credit.

4146
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,860
The hell? That's no fair!

4147
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:28,340
Exactly, it's not.

4148
00:10:29,330 --> 00:10:30,930
You need money, don't you?

4149
00:10:30,930 --> 00:10:33,480
Then you need to hurry up and get promoted.

4150
00:10:34,140 --> 00:10:36,350
And for that to happen, 
you need some results.

4151
00:10:36,620 --> 00:10:38,380
But how?

4152
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:39,350
On your own...

4153
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:43,200
You need to produce results on 
your own, rather than as a squad.

4154
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:46,320
That'll get you to your goal quicker.

4155
00:10:48,250 --> 00:10:50,320
All right. I'll do that.

4156
00:10:50,810 --> 00:10:54,760
I'm not gonna let Sassan... 
No, Sasaki get in my way!

4157
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:56,290
Good.

4158
00:10:56,290 --> 00:10:58,330
<i>Thank goodness you're a moron 
who's easy to manipulate.</i>

4159
00:10:59,540 --> 00:11:00,830
Where's Urie and Shirazu?

4160
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,750
Out looking for Torso.

4161
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:06,570
Of course, they're acting 
on their own again...

4162
00:11:06,990 --> 00:11:08,070
And Saiko?

4163
00:11:08,070 --> 00:11:10,330
She's probably in her room playing games.

4164
00:11:12,470 --> 00:11:15,040
Saiko, dinner's ready!

4165
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,180
'Kay!

4166
00:11:17,590 --> 00:11:18,580
Let's eat.

4167
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,930
Help yourself.

4168
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:23,890
It's delicious.

4169
00:11:23,890 --> 00:11:24,990
That's good to hear.

4170
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,420
Welcome back. Dinner's readâ

4171
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:29,620
Don't want any.

4172
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:34,410
Hey, Urie, about the investigation...

4173
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:36,660
Please don't worry about me.

4174
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,640
I'll capture Torso on my own.

4175
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:42,120
Please use those receipts 
toward my expenses.

4176
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:50,250
I guess everyone wants to 
investigate on their own...

4177
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:52,630
All right, fine.

4178
00:11:53,730 --> 00:11:58,940
Apparently I'm going to have to 
get serious with those two...

4179
00:11:58,940 --> 00:11:59,970
Sensei?

4180
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:01,910
Let's go, Mutsuki!

4181
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:05,480
We'll capture Torso on our own, 
before Urie and Shirazu!

4182
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:07,100
R-Right!

4183
00:12:07,730 --> 00:12:11,420
Just watch, you little fledglings! 
You, too, Investigator Shimoguchi!

4184
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:14,490
I'll show you all what 
happens when I get serious!

4185
00:12:14,530 --> 00:12:18,070
Cochlea
23rd Ward Ghoul Detention Center

4186
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:25,330
<i>Donato Porpora, otherwise 
known as Priest. SS rate.</i>

4187
00:12:26,150 --> 00:12:30,000
<i>If I remember correctly, he was 
feeding on the children in his care...</i>

4188
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,900
<i>So you brought the newbie 
with you today, Haise?</i>

4189
00:12:35,650 --> 00:12:37,860
<i>He looks delicious.</i>

4190
00:12:38,250 --> 00:12:40,010
<i>So this is a Quinx?</i>

4191
00:12:40,570 --> 00:12:48,520
<i>I would love to split open his belly and 
fill my mouth with his plump innards...</i>

4192
00:12:49,410 --> 00:12:52,390
<i>So, what brings you here today?</i>

4193
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,530
I'd like to ask you about 
a ghoul named Torso.

4194
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:59,150
The areas where he's fed 
are rather spread out.

4195
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:01,660
All of his victims are women.

4196
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:04,540
In each case, only their torsos were taken.

4197
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:08,040
<i>I see, so he lives up to his name.</i>

4198
00:13:08,580 --> 00:13:13,370
<i>Since he's moving in such a wide 
area, he must be using a car.</i>

4199
00:13:13,370 --> 00:13:14,050
Right.

4200
00:13:14,230 --> 00:13:17,370
<i>Why is he so spread out?</i>

4201
00:13:17,850 --> 00:13:20,720
<i>Is he afraid of being pin-pointed?</i>

4202
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:26,090
<i>Then he's probably a ghoul 
who's blended into society,</i>

4203
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:29,560
<i>and he's very knowledgeable about the roads.</i>

4204
00:13:30,090 --> 00:13:31,770
<i>He's a taxi driver.</i>

4205
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:36,520
<i>Urie already realized this.</i>

4206
00:13:40,610 --> 00:13:43,640
I have a message from the 
Aogiri Tree, Mr. Torso.

4207
00:13:43,940 --> 00:13:45,040
Message?

4208
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,490
You're feeding too much.

4209
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:49,040
It appears as though you're being tracked.

4210
00:13:49,490 --> 00:13:50,970
By the CCG?

4211
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:54,410
Have you ever heard of the Quinx?

4212
00:13:54,410 --> 00:13:55,050
No...

4213
00:13:55,760 --> 00:14:00,550
Despite being human, they apparently 
have the abilities of a ghoul.

4214
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,680
Please be on your guard.

4215
00:14:03,850 --> 00:14:05,230
<i>Quinx, huh?</i>

4216
00:14:06,170 --> 00:14:09,170
<i>Almost sounds like you, Brother.</i>

4217
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:12,600
Those're Sassan's underwear.

4218
00:14:14,180 --> 00:14:15,200
Sniff, sniff.

4219
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,360
Don't worry.

4220
00:14:16,730 --> 00:14:19,070
I brought a pair that were 
washed and hung out to dry.

4221
00:14:19,070 --> 00:14:20,780
Then, here's this in return.

4222
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,720
What's this?

4223
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,830
Pictures that were dropped 
near the crime scenes.

4224
00:14:24,830 --> 00:14:26,740
His victims are in the pictures, right?

4225
00:14:27,230 --> 00:14:30,120
I think they were taken by Torso.

4226
00:14:30,450 --> 00:14:35,380
A special kind of film from overseas was used, 
and they only sell it in certain places.

4227
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:39,380
And this is the person who 
bought a bunch of that film.

4228
00:14:40,170 --> 00:14:42,890
His name is Saeki Karao. 
His occupation is...

4229
00:14:48,690 --> 00:14:52,020
A surgical scar from an appendectomy, 
a surgical scar from a C section,

4230
00:14:52,580 --> 00:14:54,230
and a scar from an injury...

4231
00:14:54,230 --> 00:14:55,820
The thing that all the victims have in common

4232
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:58,030
is that they all had scars 
somewhere on their torso.

4233
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:02,540
But how can we tell if they had a 
scar there before they were attacked?

4234
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:03,570
Take a look at this.

4235
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:06,930
The spots where Torso fed upon his victims

4236
00:15:06,930 --> 00:15:11,290
spread out in a radius around the hospitals the victims had gone to.

4237
00:15:12,290 --> 00:15:14,250
Let's split up and check out the hospitals.

4238
00:15:14,830 --> 00:15:19,750
Oh, but even if you see someone suspicious, 
make sure you don't act on your own.

4239
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:22,270
<i>I guess we're going to have to 
visit them one by one, but...</i>

4240
00:15:36,150 --> 00:15:38,650
Pardon me. I need a ride.

4241
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:42,680
The city's full of taxis.

4242
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:43,650
Yeah.

4243
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:46,160
<i>Just shut up and find him, you useless fool.</i>

4244
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:51,860
<i>Mutsuki: In pursuit of Torso</i>

4245
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:51,870
Mutsuki's in pursuit of Torso?

4246
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:54,020
Huh? Where is he?

4247
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:54,870
Make a U-turn.

4248
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:03,130
Sir...

4249
00:16:06,210 --> 00:16:10,480
Which one are you, sir?

4250
00:16:11,130 --> 00:16:12,490
Go faster.

4251
00:16:12,490 --> 00:16:14,690
You're going to make me break the law!

4252
00:16:14,690 --> 00:16:15,820
I don't care!

4253
00:16:21,510 --> 00:16:23,360
Sir...!

4254
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:26,860
Dove...

4255
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:36,460
You're great... You're wonderful.

4256
00:16:44,490 --> 00:16:46,880
That number... That has to be him.

4257
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:47,810
It's Torso!

4258
00:16:50,180 --> 00:16:51,680
Damn it!

4259
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:55,610
What the hell? What the hell?

4260
00:16:55,610 --> 00:16:57,440
I don't have my mask today...

4261
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:58,940
The tires!

4262
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,200
Aim for the tires with your kagune.

4263
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:01,940
Huh?

4264
00:17:02,490 --> 00:17:06,410
Better not complain even if I miss!

4265
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:10,010
You suck.

4266
00:17:10,010 --> 00:17:12,640
I told you I'd probably miss. 
Don't make me drop you.

4267
00:17:13,450 --> 00:17:15,910
<i>You on the bike and the taxi 
in front, stop immediately.</i>

4268
00:17:18,690 --> 00:17:19,880
They're in pursuit of a ghoul?

4269
00:17:20,370 --> 00:17:21,590
Let's help them out.

4270
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:27,180
You in the taxi, stop immeâ

4271
00:17:29,950 --> 00:17:31,140
You bastard!

4272
00:17:39,630 --> 00:17:40,700
A barrier?

4273
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,790
Is it Investigator Sasaki?

4274
00:17:48,890 --> 00:17:51,390
I can aim just fine if I'm not moving!

4275
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:58,120
So they're Quinx?

4276
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:00,710
They're basically ghouls.

4277
00:18:00,710 --> 00:18:02,750
They're definitely not human anymore.

4278
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:07,390
<i>I have to fight, too.</i>

4279
00:18:08,470 --> 00:18:14,320
<i>Come, come, come, come, 
come... Come on, kagune!</i>

4280
00:18:15,390 --> 00:18:16,020
<i>It's no use...</i>

4281
00:18:16,970 --> 00:18:20,560
<i>Both of them can use theirs 
so efficiently, and yet I...</i>

4282
00:18:21,330 --> 00:18:23,090
He's regenerating really fast.

4283
00:18:23,090 --> 00:18:24,690
Don't hold back on your attacks.

4284
00:18:24,690 --> 00:18:26,660
We'll hit him with all 
we've got and capture him!

4285
00:18:27,870 --> 00:18:29,360
Yeah, about that...

4286
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:30,410
Those plans are canceled.

4287
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:35,500
What are you called again? Quinx?

4288
00:18:36,020 --> 00:18:37,340
You can use kagune, right?

4289
00:18:37,870 --> 00:18:38,530
Whaâ

4290
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:41,230
S-rate... Orochi!

4291
00:18:41,230 --> 00:18:42,500
That's him?

4292
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:47,000
Honestly, the Doves do 
pretty shitty things, too.

4293
00:18:47,490 --> 00:18:49,410
They're no different from the Aogiri.

4294
00:18:50,210 --> 00:18:53,580
But while we're at it, let's play!

4295
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:02,980
Sorry, I won't hold back on any Doves.

4296
00:19:05,620 --> 00:19:07,860
What the hell was that? A pea shooter?

4297
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:09,360
It didn't even scratch him?

4298
00:19:18,850 --> 00:19:20,080
<i>My kagune...</i>

4299
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:26,460
In the end, you're all just fakes.

4300
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:29,490
<i>Urie is struggling that badly...</i>

4301
00:19:32,090 --> 00:19:34,800
<i>Does that mean I have any chance at all?</i>

4302
00:19:35,260 --> 00:19:38,110
What? There's another one?

4303
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:40,520
Then I guess I'll take care of you fiâ

4304
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:43,480
Point-blank bomber!

4305
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:46,650
Toru, run!

4306
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:53,530
Ugh, not only are you lame,

4307
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:55,920
you're annoying!

4308
00:20:00,430 --> 00:20:02,030
Let's fall back for now.

4309
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:05,790
My kagune's done. We need to retreat.

4310
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:07,660
<i>Retreat?</i>

4311
00:20:08,170 --> 00:20:09,800
I'm sorry, Kuki.

4312
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:15,930
The squad leader stayed behind and ordered 
the rest of the S3 squad to retreat.

4313
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:18,460
I'm sorry,

4314
00:20:18,870 --> 00:20:21,120
we couldn't protect your father.

4315
00:20:24,540 --> 00:20:25,810
You can't be serious!

4316
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:29,020
Hey, you idiot! What are you doing?!

4317
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:32,200
I'm feeding so I can activate my kagune!

4318
00:20:33,050 --> 00:20:35,780
<i>Ascend, ascend, ascend, ascend, 
ascend, ascend, ascend!</i>

4319
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:39,030
Seriously? Yeah, we're done now.

4320
00:20:41,610 --> 00:20:42,590
Sassan!

4321
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:43,540
Sensei!

4322
00:20:43,980 --> 00:20:46,110
Oh? Who the hell are you?

4323
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:48,850
Are you the king of those fakes there?

4324
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:52,760
<i>He's... There's something...</i>

4325
00:20:53,390 --> 00:20:54,550
Don't you dare...

4326
00:20:55,330 --> 00:20:56,810
lay a finger on my subordinates!

4327
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:01,610
Quit scuttling... around!

4328
00:21:07,270 --> 00:21:10,900
Man, you guys are flimsy. 
You're almost like tofu.

4329
00:21:11,530 --> 00:21:13,280
Guess I'll aim over here.

4330
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:17,960
Sassan!

4331
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:20,120
Hurry up and retreat!

4332
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:20,940
But...

4333
00:21:20,940 --> 00:21:22,130
Hurry up, and go!

4334
00:21:22,130 --> 00:21:23,290
Too slow!

4335
00:21:26,490 --> 00:21:27,670
He's strong.

4336
00:21:27,870 --> 00:21:29,840
<i>It's been a while since I've 
encountered a ghoul like this...</i>

4337
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:31,360
You're weak, Haise.

4338
00:21:33,970 --> 00:21:37,390
At this rate, he's going 
to kill your subordinates.

4339
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:39,590
